# shellcheck settings for this repository, read by tests/ci.sh and tests/test_static_guards.sh
# (shellcheck finds this file from the script's own directory upwards).
#
# Info and style findings that are deliberate here:
#   SC1091  tests source tests/lib.sh by a path built at run time; shellcheck cannot follow it
#   SC2015  "A && gate ... ok || gate ... FAIL": both branches are gate lines, so C running
#           after a true A cannot happen by design
#   SC2016  awk and sed programs live in single quotes on purpose; the shell must not expand them
#   SC1003  case patterns such as *'\'* match a backslash or an apostrophe literally
#   SC2012  resolve_link parses "ls -ld" only to read a link target where readlink is missing
#   SC2181  one reply check reads $? after a command substitution on purpose
# Warnings are never disabled here; a deliberate one carries an inline directive and a reason.
shell=sh
disable=SC1091,SC2015,SC2016,SC1003,SC2012,SC2181
